OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about CarFest
OL,4,
OL,5,FMusic and motoring festival CarFest is
OL,6,Fto take place at Silverstone for the
OL,7,Ffirst time this weekend.
OL,9,FThe event runs from Friday until
OL,10,FSunday, with headliners featuring
OL,11,FJessie J, Sir Tom Jones and Nile
OL,12,FRodgers & Chic.
OL,14,FOrganisers previously said the move to
OL,15,Fthe famous Northamptonshire circuit
OL,16,F"means that no one from either north or
OL,17,Fsouth has an excuse not to join us".
OL,19,FWhat can festival-goers expect to see
OL,20,Fand do this year?
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
